ljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3622:   declaration: PHP declares it before the unit's first statement runs.\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3627:(defn- declared-functions\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3628:  \"Every function the unit declares: lower-cased fully qualified name to the\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3648:  \"The entry unit's declared path when the composition names none.\"\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3663:     (assoc ctx :declared (declared-functions ctx)))))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3667:  \"A top-level function declared twice, or over a builtin, is a compile\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3675:                (compile-error! f (str \"Cannot redeclare \" written \"()\")))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3688:   then the classes that can be declared at that point (PHP hoists a class\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3702:                     (app* 'php/declare-late! (u/v sym))\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3777:   need); `:path` the entry unit's declared path (default `entry-path`);\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3891:    :yang.php/refusal :yang.php/undeclared-free registry\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3948:    :yang.php/refusal :yang.php/undeclared-free registry\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:4000:                 :yang.php/refusal :yang.php/undeclared-free registry\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
